plasm_expr	Meaning
v9	ref:Document · Document slug or id this API uses
v6	markdown
v7	string · Short text
v4	json · JSON object
v2	boolean · true/false flag (for example resolve thread)
v8	uuid · Optional idempotency key so you can retry the same edit batch safely
v3	integer · Integer
agent_id	v7
base_revision	v3
base_token	v7
by	v7
content	v6
find	markdown · markdown
fromRef	string · string
idempotency_key	v8
mark_id	v7
operations	json · json · operations
presence_status	v7
quote	v6
ref	string · string
report	v6 · Full bug report
resolve	v2
share_token	v7
status	v7
text	v6
up_to_id	v7
slug	v9
markdown	v6
title	v7
links	v4 · SDK link bundle (state, ops, docs). Wire key _links
agent_auth	v4 · Auth hints from share JSON agent.auth (token source, header names)
v210{mark_id=<wire>,text=<wire>,resolve=<wire>}	→ comment_reply — Reply in a thread; optionally resolve in the same step
v211{mark_id=<wire>}	→ comment_resolve — Resolve a thread; keep history
v212{mark_id=<wire>}	→ comment_unresolve — Unresolve a thread for more replies
v101{ref=<wire>,markdown=<wire>}	→ replace_block — Replace one block’s markdown
v102{ref=<wire>,blocks=<wire>}	→ insert_before — Insert blocks before the anchor block
v103{ref=<wire>,blocks=<wire>}	→ insert_after — Insert blocks after the anchor block
v104{ref=<wire>}	→ delete_block — Delete one block
v105{fromRef=<wire>,toRef=<wire>,blocks=<wire>}	→ replace_range — Replace a range of blocks with new blocks
v106{ref=<wire>,find=<wire>,replace=<wire>,occurrence=<wire>}	→ find_replace_in_block — Find and replace text inside one block
v107{find=<wire>,replace=<wire>,occurrence=<wire>,fromRef=<wire>,toRef=<wire>,blockFilter=<wire>}	→ find_replace_in_doc — Find and replace text across the document (optional block range or kind filter)
v10	union · v210 | v211 | v212
v11	union · v101 | v102 | v103 | v104 | v105 | v106 | v107
e1[slug,markdown,title,links,agent_auth]	noun · Read or edit a shared Proof document
